--[[
	PropsTundraGatesData (dev tool data) - the 4 tundra gates of the owner's "TUNDRA (SNOW BIOME) PROP IMPROVEMENT - Gates and
	entrances" (2026-10-22) as they were before the remake, read from the GAME copies (Tundra_1.EntryArch, Tundra_<n>.Gate;
	the kits and test copies are the same models, the palisade and castle gates off by 0.05 .. 0.15 on a few parts). One row
	per part: { name, class, shape, sx, sy, sz, x, y, z, r00, r01, r02, r10, r11, r12, r20, r21, r22, hex, collide,
	transparency, material, parent ("" = the model, else the parent part's name, e.g. Barrier), query [, meshId,
	collisionFidelity] }; the CFrame is in the model's pivot space. The builders (DevTools.PropsTundraGates) place their
	details on these parts; the colliding rows become the invisible Collision parts (exact collisions), the functional
	parts (Barrier, PriceSign, NameSign, Ember, Lantern) are rebuilt from them exactly. Source of truth:
	tools/PropsTundraGatesData.luau.
]]
